  "text": "India mein **men’s formal shirts** ke liye main brands ko roughly is tarah rank karunga:\n\n| Brand | Best for | Typical budget |\n|---|---|---:|\n| **Louis Philippe** | Premium, classy corporate look | ₹1,500–3,500+ |\n| **Van Heusen** | Best all-rounder, daily office | ₹1,000–2,500 |\n| **Arrow** | Classic, conservative formal look | ₹1,000–3,000 |\n| **Blackberrys** | Sharper/slimmer modern fit | ₹1,500–3,000 |\n| **Raymond** | Classic, mature formal style | ₹1,500–3,500 |\n| **Park Avenue** | Good everyday office wear | ₹900–2,500 |\n| **Peter England** | Best value/budget | ₹700–1,500 |\n| **Allen Solly** | Slightly more stylish/modern | ₹1,000–2,500 |\n\n\nCurrent 2026 comparisons also consistently place **Van Heusen, Louis Philippe, Arrow, Peter England, Raymond, Blackberrys and Park Avenue** among the stronger formal-shirt options in India. [www.flickonclick.com](https://www.flickonclick.com/best-formal-shirt-brands/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### Meri personal pick\n- **₹800–1,200:** Peter England\n- **₹1,200–2,000:** **Van Heusen — best overall value**\n- **₹1,500–2,500:** Arrow / Blackberrys\n- **₹2,000+:** **Louis Philippe** — premium look\n\n### [Van Heusen Men Solid Formal Shirt]()\n*₹840*\n\n### [Arrow Men's Formal Shirt]()\n*₹1,029*\n\n### [Louis Philippe Men Shirt]()\n*₹1,724*\n\n### [Park Avenue Men's Formal Shirt]()\n*₹974*\n\n### [Peter England Men's Slim Fit Formal Shirt]()\n*₹863*\n\n**Tip:** Brand se zyada **fit + fabric** important hai. Office ke liye pehle **white, light blue, light grey, subtle stripes/checks** lo. 100% cotton ya good-quality cotton blend aur proper shoulder fit dekho. [dressingschool.com](https://dressingschool.com/picks/formal-shirts/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar tum mujhe **budget (₹1k/₹2k/₹3k), body type (slim/normal/heavy) aur office type (corporate/IT/bank/business)** bata do, main tumhare liye **exact 5 shirts** recommend kar sakta hoon.",
